# Laravel Backend

This directory contains the Laravel API backend for ClinicAI Pro SaaS.

## Planned structure

```text
backend/
├── app/
│   ├── Http/
│   ├── Models/
│   ├── Policies/
│   ├── Services/
│   └── Providers/
├── config/
├── database/
│   ├── factories/
│   ├── migrations/
│   └── seeders/
├── routes/
├── public/
├── storage/
├── tests/
├── .env.example
├── artisan
├── composer.json
└── phpunit.xml
```

## Initial backend setup plan

1. Install Laravel 12 application in this directory
2. Configure Sanctum and RBAC
3. Generate migrations for clinics, users, roles, and permissions
4. Add API versioning, resources, policies, and service classes
5. Add AI request and audit log models

## Production notes

- Use Apache rewrite rules to serve from `public/`
- Set `APP_ENV=production`
- Ensure `storage/` and `bootstrap/cache/` are writable
- Run migrations via CLI

## Examples of intended endpoints

- `/api/v1/auth/login`
- `/api/v1/clinics`
- `/api/v1/patients`
- `/api/v1/appointments`
- `/api/v1/billing/invoices`
- `/api/v1/ai/assist`
